<title>CHINA: China heavy oil output down 16.1 pct in Jan-Feb.</title>
<headline>China heavy oil output down 16.1 pct in Jan-Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 3.4828 million tonnes of heavy oil in the first two months of this year, down 16.1 percent from the same period of 1996, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>China produced 1.7087 million tonnes of heavy oil in February alone, the bureau said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
